{title: Nothing But the Blood (Hymm)}
{artist: Unknown}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]What can wash [Em]away my sin?
[G]Nothing but the [C]blood of [D]Jes[G]us.
[G]What can make me [Em]whole again?
[G]Nothing but the [C]blood of [D]Jes[G]us.

{comment: Chorus}
[G]Oh, precious is the flow,
[D]That makes me white as [C]snow;
[G]No other [Em]fount I know,
[G]Nothing but the [C]blood of [D]Jes[G]us.

{comment: Verse 2}
For my pardon this I see,
Nothing but the blood of Jesus.
For my cleansing this my plea,
Nothing but the blood of Jesus.

{comment: Verse 3}
Nothing can for sin atone,
Nothing but the blood of Jesus.
Naught of good that I have done,
Nothing but the blood of Jesus.

{comment: Verse 4}
This is all my hope and peace,
Nothing but the blood of Jesus.
This is all my righteousness,
Nothing but the blood of Jesus.
